---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---

<Section
  id="contact"
  label="Contact"
  title="Get in touch"
  lede="Every machine that has to answer for what it did is now software: robots and medical devices, spacecraft and defense platforms, industrial controllers and patient monitors, and every system a regulator, an insurer, or a court will one day ask to prove what happened."
  band
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      That range is wider than any single market. Every system that joins the physical world to
      software ends up holding a record of its own past, and the further it sits from a server, the
      more that record matters and the less room there is to keep it. Ktema answers multi-axis
      questions about that record on the device, inside the few kilobytes the device actually has.
    </p>
    <p>
      The first design partners are being chosen from across that range. If you are building a
      machine that has to answer for itself, write to us. 
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn btn--accent" href={`mailto:${site.contact}`}>Write to us</a>
    <a class="btn" href={site.docs}>Read the documentation</a>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }
</style>
